  [38;5;153mlocalStorage[39m. Tests would cover saving and reading back, [38;5;153mgetUserId[39m, [38;5;153mclearSession[39m, broken JSON giving [38;5;153mnull[39m and getting
  cleaned up, and storage that throws errors. [38;5;153mapp.js[39m touches the page directly, so I'd check it by hand in a browser,
  served over HTTP.

